---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Agentic Marketing OS Map · Rivett Field Kit"
  description="A premium Rivett field kit for mapping inputs, memory, roles, tools, approvals, and heartbeat in an agentic marketing system."
  currentNav="field-kits"
>
  <main class="os-page">
    <section class="os-hero">
      <div class="page os-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="stamp">Field Kit 02 · Operating map</div>
          <h1>Your AI stack is not <span class="ital">a marketing OS.</span></h1>
          <p class="lede">Use this six-layer map to see where your campaign work still depends on you carrying every handoff.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="/field-kits/agentic-marketing-os-map.pdf" download>Download PDF →</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/blog/ai-marketing-operating-system">Read the note</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/diagnostic">Book diagnostic</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="os-diagram" aria-label="Agentic Marketing OS diagram">
          <div class="diagram-title">Agentic Marketing OS</div>
          <div class="layer"><span>01</span><b>Inputs</b><em>Customer language, calls, signals, results</em></div>
          <div class="layer"><span>02</span><b>Memory</b><em>Audience, offer, proof, voice, objections</em></div>
          <div class="layer"><span>03</span><b>Roles</b><em>Researcher, strategist, writer, QA</em></div>
          <div class="layer"><span>04</span><b>Tools</b><em>Browser, CRM, files, analytics, assets</em></div>
          <div class="layer"><span>05</span><b>Approvals</b><em>What can draft, change, send, publish</em></div>
          <div class="layer"><span>06</span><b>Heartbeat</b><em>Daily, weekly, signal-based runs</em></div>
          <div class="output">Review-ready decisions</div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page os-split">
      <div class="side-label">The gap</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Every task got faster. The campaign still waits.</h2>
        <p>Research is faster. Copy is faster. Images are faster. Reporting is faster. But if a human still carries every handoff, the system did not change.</p>
        <p>The OS Map shows which layer is missing before you buy another tool.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page score-section">
      <div class="score-head">
        <span class="label">Readiness score</span>
        <h2>Score the six layers before you build.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="score-grid">
        <div><b>Inputs</b><span>Scattered notes or clear source set?</span><em>0-2</em></div>
        <div><b>Memory</b><span>In heads or agent-readable vault?</span><em>0-2</em></div>
        <div><b>Roles</b><span>One person does all or defined outputs?</span><em>0-2</em></div>
        <div><b>Tools</b><span>Manual tabs or connected workbench?</span><em>0-2</em></div>
        <div><b>Approvals</b><span>Ad hoc review or clear permission map?</span><em>0-2</em></div>
        <div><b>Heartbeat</b><span>Manual prompts or scheduled runs?</span><em>0-2</em></div>
      </div>
      <div class="score-key">
        <span><b>0-4</b> AI-assisted work</span>
        <span><b>5-8</b> Pieces of an operating layer</span>
        <span><b>9-12</b> Ready for agent workflows</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="machine-band">
      <div class="page machine-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="label">First build</span>
          <h2>The weekly campaign brief machine.</h2>
          <p>It is narrow enough to build and useful enough to matter. It touches research, strategy, proof, copy, and approval without giving an agent permission to publish.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="machine-flow">
          <div><span>Inputs</span><b>Performance, customer phrases, competitors, product notes, objections</b></div>
          <div><span>Memory</span><b>Audience, offer, proof, voice, objections</b></div>
          <div><span>Roles</span><b>Researcher, strategist, copywriter, QA, operator</b></div>
          <div><span>Output</span><b>Campaign thesis, angles, asset directions, risks, decisions needed</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page prompt-section">
      <div class="prompt-card">
        <span class="label">Mapping prompt</span>
        <pre><code>You are mapping our marketing operation into an agentic OS.

Inspect:
1. Inputs.
2. Memory.
3. Roles.
4. Tools.
5. Approvals.
6. Heartbeat.

For each layer, identify:
- What exists now.
- What is missing.
- What work still depends on a human handoff.
- The smallest useful workflow to build first.</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="brief-preview">
        <span class="label">Review-ready output</span>
        <h2>The first useful artifact is a brief.</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Campaign thesis</li>
          <li>Buyer belief to challenge</li>
          <li>Source signals</li>
          <li>Proof we can use</li>
          <li>Landing page direction</li>
          <li>Risks and decisions needed</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .os-page .stamp,.os-page .label,.os-page .side-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .os-page .stamp::before,.os-page .label::before,.os-page .side-label::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;margin-right:12px;transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .os-hero{padding:76px 0 68px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .os-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 460px;gap:72px;align-items:center}
  .os-hero h1{font-size:clamp(54px,7vw,104px);line-height:0.92;letter-spacing:-0.055em;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:920px;text-wrap:balance}
  .os-hero .ital{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-dim);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .os-hero .lede{font-size:22px;line-height:1.48;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:640px;margin:34px 0 0}
  .os-page .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px}
  .os-page .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:46px;padding:13px 18px;border:1px solid var(--ink);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .os-page .btn.primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
  .os-page .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}
  .os-diagram{border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper-2);padding:24px}
  .diagram-title{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint);padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .layer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:8px 16px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .layer span{grid-row:1/3;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:var(--accent-deep);padding-top:4px}
  .layer b{font-size:22px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em}
  .layer em{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--ink-dim)}
  .output{margin-top:18px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:16px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center}
  .os-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;gap:64px;padding-top:72px;padding-bottom:72px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .os-split h2,.score-head h2,.machine-band h2,.brief-preview h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.045em;margin:0;max-width:760px;text-wrap:balance}
  .os-split p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:760px;margin:22px 0 0}
  .score-section{padding-top:76px;padding-bottom:84px}
  .score-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:32px}
  .score-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .score-grid div{min-height:174px;padding:22px 20px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .score-grid div:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}
  .score-grid b{display:block;font-size:25px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.035em}
  .score-grid span{display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink-dim);margin-top:14px}
  .score-grid em{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-style:normal;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;color:var(--accent-deep);margin-top:28px}
  .score-key{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--ink);margin-top:28px}
  .score-key span{padding:18px;border-right:1px solid var(--ink);font-size:17px;line-height:1.35}
  .score-key span:last-child{border-right:0}
  .score-key b{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.2em;margin-right:10px;color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .machine-band{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:76px 0}
  .machine-band .label{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72)}
  .machine-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px;align-items:start}
  .machine-band h2{color:var(--paper);margin-top:20px}
  .machine-band p{font-size:20px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);max-width:560px;margin-top:24px}
  .machine-flow{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.28)}
  .machine-flow div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:24px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18)}
  .machine-flow span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
  .machine-flow b{font-size:21px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .prompt-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:48px;padding-top:84px;padding-bottom:96px}
  .prompt-card{background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);padding:28px}
  .prompt-card pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;margin:18px 0 0}
  .brief-preview ol{margin:28px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;counter-reset:item;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .brief-preview li{counter-increment:item;padding:18px 0 18px 58px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;position:relative}
  .brief-preview li::before{content:counter(item, decimal-leading-zero);position:absolute;left:0;top:21px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:var(--accent-deep)}
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .os-hero-grid,.os-split,.score-head,.machine-grid,.prompt-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}
    .score-grid,.score-key{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .score-grid div,.score-grid div:nth-child(3n),.score-key span{border-right:0}
    .score-key span{border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}
    .score-key span:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  }
  @media print{
    .site-header,.mobile-menu,.actions{display:none !important}
    .os-hero{padding-top:28px}
    .os-hero,.os-split,.score-section,.machine-band,.prompt-section{break-inside:avoid}
    .os-hero-grid,.os-split,.score-head,.machine-grid,.prompt-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}
    .score-grid,.score-key{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .score-grid div,.score-grid div:nth-child(3n),.score-key span{border-right:0}
    .machine-band{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
    .machine-band h2{color:var(--ink)}
    .machine-band p{color:var(--ink-dim)}
    .machine-band .label{color:var(--accent-deep)}
    .machine-flow div{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .machine-flow b{color:var(--ink)}
  }
</style>
